      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c884ad85cc24ff7a50707a13955206d326345130b22162f78f75ee70a4ddc402.png] \n\nWe can solve percentage by remember some fraction\n\n66(2)/(3)\\% = (2)/(3), 12(1)/(2)\\% = (1)/(8) and 11(1)/(9)\\% = (1)/(9)\n\n⇒ (2/3) × (1/8) × (1/9) × y = 4\n\n⇒ y = (4 × 3 × 8 × 9)/2\n\n⇒ y = 864/2\n\n⇒ y = 432\n\n∴ The value of y is 432. \n\n**Traditional method:**\n\n**Given:**\n\n66(2)/(3)\\% × 12(1)/(2)\\% × 11(1)/(9)\\% × y = 4\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nAccording to the question, we have\n\n⇒ 66(2)/(3)\\% × 12(1)/(2)\\% × 11(1)/(9)\\% × y = 4\n\n⇒ frac{{200}}{3}\\% × frac{{25}}{2}\\% × frac{{100}}{9}\\% × y = 4\n\n⇒ frac{{200}}{300} × frac{{25}}{200} × frac{{100}}{900} × y = 4\n\n⇒ (2/3) × (1/8) × (1/9) × y = 4\n\n⇒ y = (4 × 3 × 8 × 9)/2\n\n⇒ y = 864/2\n\n⇒ y = 432\n\n**∴ The value of y is 432.** \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f13e2ad6582c16aa62a83672e2547ad20a01fddb61962a1acce42eb9a1a99caa.png] **__Additional Information__**\n\n [IMAGE: https://chat.google.com/u/0/api/get_attachment_url?url_type=FIFE_URL&content_type=image%2Fpng&attachment_token=AAUuIGuhBy1E5lQTPZYP7SdKkTuyRgc4djqJbT8KcC98G5Oe18%2FsI%2BD3Ij83iuqEkjmOB9rm49NR%2BUJ2oIPBipMEcBP%2BELehSPkPTJYGqYnVtAnWCMJCcEe%2FMvXXe869wfBhKzRRAZcUFFO0Sy4ENss%2BI55iQTBeuE6VZG9YlCCeWGoVnVPxK3eZwAMYaBen21zZtsbH%2BiZFoW0HrN%2Fm%2BIUux2%2B678LWnUPZtCK4o1SearcGIukDDyd9JeCFMgXXA1sKMKIlbFYFDiv2JYQvDCpcWjKGUH1I5kX9ECpVn8e7l%2BSXo1dlFbPGnDi8bmsyOZTxAkZAXL63%2FE6rrY3rpLec%2BPWmOSqrJCN4QusgLGoli3QkGYto3c%2B7bWvr%2Fim8T8bQvf8Dz%2Bp7sGTc%2BwAwEIUlrIzMRWyjJ0w%2FXSIglf8Iu082pRGRQpUrFi7Ai5PjAe2yIDJ2NrNVc6uthIQiqODgzWgvZK5QfHy5kHYLYx4hJOvVcdUCv95vO9tCK8R6jvqcvvogialS47laGff5fFHp3Q%3D%3D&sz=w512] \n\n36:Tfda,\n&",
