      "solution": "**Given:**\n\n15% of 1,500 + 1,600 × 12.5% - 62.5% of 400\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4929dca6c9d94226408c3276fe60ae4c2c51935e059138fccad660931268312b.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n15% of 1,500 + 1,600 × 12.5% - 62.5% of 400\n\n⇒ (15 / 100) × 1,500 + (1,600 × 1 / 8) - (5 / 8 × 400) **[12.5% = 1 / 8] [62.5% = 5 / 8]**\n\n⇒ 225 + 200 - 250\n\n⇒ 425 - 250\n\n⇒ 175",
