      "question": "25% of 66.67% of 75% of 80% of a number is 6347. Find 40% of that number.",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "24388"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "23388"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "25388"
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "26388"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "3",
      "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPercentage values: 25%, 66.67%, 75%, 80%\n\n**Solution:**\n\nLet \"x\" be the unknown number.\n\n25% of 66.67% of 75% of 80% of x = 6347\n\n⇒ [(25/100) × (66.67/100) × (75/100) × (80/100)] × x = 6347\n\n⇒ [(1/4) × (2/3) × (3/4) × (4/5] × x = 6347\n\n⇒ 1/10 × x = 6347\n\n⇒ x = 63470\n\n40% of the number x = (40/100) × 63470\n\n⇒ 2/5 × 63470\n\n⇒ 25388\n\n**Therefore, 40% of the unknown number is 25388.**",
      "tags": [
        "Simplification"
      ]
    },
